# Generated at runtime by index.php — never commit these. (.gallery-items.php
# holds your captions and any GPS coordinates; the others are stats and the
# login throttle. The .json names are the 1.x stats files, kept ignored too.
# .gallery-config.php is a deployment's own settings file and holds its
# passwords; the shareable template is gallery-config.example.php.)
.gallery-cache/
.gallery-config.php
.gallery-items.php
.gallery-stats.php
.gallery-login-attempts.php
.gallery-secret.php
.gallery-health.php
.gallery-links.php
.gallery-linklog-*.php
.gallery-stats.json
.gallery-stats.sqlite
.gallery-stats.sqlite-wal
.gallery-stats.sqlite-shm

# Local sample/test photos, if you keep a folder for manual testing
/test-photos/
/sandbox/

# OS / editor junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# Python bytecode from the tools in tests/tools
__pycache__/
*.pyc
